  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "In my defense, it's because those words, in the form of the Sacred Writs, were stolen from us generations ago by... the Ghost Who Squawks.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Hierarchs_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Juju_LM-URSAI_024.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520123,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "*Gasps!* The very name is terrifying!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Bear_IslanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Ursai_Villagers_LM-URSAI_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520129,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So the Ghost is real?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Bear_Islander_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Kodi_LM-URSAI_015.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520126,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "He is. But he is not a Ghost. He is a monster. And his real name is: the Bantam!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Hierarchs_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Juju_LM-URSAI_025.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520123,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "*Louder gasps!* That name is slightly less terrifying, but I'm still concerned!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Bear_IslanderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Ursai_Villagers_LM-URSAI_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520129,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Bantam and his Koolakamba thugs hate everything Ursai Village stands for, especially our relationship with our Founder, the Ol' Boi.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Hierarchs_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Juju_LM-URSAI_026.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520123,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Bantam stole the Sacred Writs and keeps them like a prize in his lair to sever that relationship, to keep us from His words.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Hierarchs_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Juju_LM-URSAI_027.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520123,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ursai has miraculously gone generations without botching the Killawahoo Ceremony, but here we are. Now, we need the Sacred Writs for guidance.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Hierarchs_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Juju_LM-URSAI_028.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520123,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We're begging you, Wizard. Please rescue the Sacred Writs from the Bantam in the Temple of Truth before the Angry Mountain devours us all.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Hierarchs_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Juju_LM-URSAI_029.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520123,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "By the Ol' Boi's boots, you did it! You got the Sacred Writs! Let me have a look at them.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Hierarchs_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Juju_LM-URSAI_031.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520123,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "'From the mouth of the Old One...' yada yada... 'Lemurs shall be my shepherds...' uh huh... 'thou shalt not eat calamari...' The heck is calamari?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Hierarchs_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Juju_LM-URSAI_032.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520123,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Anwhoo, let me just find the bit about the Killawahoo... Ah ha! Here we are... Uh huh. Mmhm. Oh. Oh. Oooh.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Hierarchs_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Juju_LM-URSAI_033.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520123,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Well, Juju, what does it say? Does it tell us how to circumvent fiery doom?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Bear_Islander_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Kodi_LM-URSAI_016.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520126,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Well...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Hierarchs_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Juju_LM-URSAI_034.mp3",
